#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100613 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "288e49b0-f706-54de-86b7-a17248fe2408" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Parallelogram Spanned by Two Non-Parallel Vectors"}] :question/id #uuid "fe75d710-2f18-5ddb-9f93-3127d8cec7ed" :question/math-academy-id "e-4437" :question/problem "Calculate the area of the parallelogram spanned by $\\textbf{u}=\\langle 1,2 \\rangle$ and $\\textbf{v}=\\langle 3, -3 \\rangle$." :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 \\\\ 2 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ndet(M) &= \\begin{vmatrix}1 & 3 \\\\ 2 & -3\\end{vmatrix} \\\\\n&= 1 \\cdot (-3) - 3 \\cdot 2 \\\\\n&=-9\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $\\det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA = \\mid {-9} \\mid = 9\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100614 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0272b8d6-8400-5a6d-b51d-fc6ca84bd166" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Parallelogram Spanned by Two Parallel Vectors"}] :question/id #uuid "c824ba23-c39c-5205-81a3-98d2e4b823f3" :question/math-academy-id "e-4438" :question/problem "Calculate the area of the parallelogram spanned by $\\textbf{u}=\\langle 3,-2 \\rangle$ and $\\textbf{v}=\\langle 6, -4 \\rangle$." :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 6 \\\\ -2 & -4\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\ndet(M) &= \\begin{vmatrix}3 & 6 \\\\ -2 & -4\\end{vmatrix} \\\\\n&= 3 \\cdot (-4) - 6 \\cdot (-2) \\\\\n&= 0\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $\\det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA = \\mid \\,0\\, \\mid = 0\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186268921 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "288e49b0-f706-54de-86b7-a17248fe2408" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Parallelogram Spanned by Two Non-Parallel Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "13f5cda8-bdfc-5d85-838a-66fa58675f96" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268923} {:answer/id #uuid "8772228e-9255-54ea-84f4-2407276340a8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268924} {:answer/id #uuid "e5f7acdd-6986-5621-a928-60662fe5e229" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "10" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268925} {:answer/id #uuid "1cd9010a-694a-5d20-ba4d-5db39864262a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268926} {:answer/id #uuid "9b802f4a-2c3d-5300-8e6e-a053bd38a55c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268927}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e5f7acdd-6986-5621-a928-60662fe5e229" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "10" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268925} :answer-field/id #uuid "d9fea1c1-ece9-5ee9-a22a-fc2ed323c176" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268922}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "39a1bafc-9b8e-5f68-81b3-bc3b3cf59c38" :question/math-academy-id "q-13944" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13956518/assets/7a70285258e584708a7296a2a008536dec9c97750b48e5fe0eb2f8cb7761bed1.png)\n\nCalculate the area of the parallelogram in the figure." :question/worked-solution "From the diagram, we get the vectors\n\n$$\n\\text{u}=⟨3,2⟩,\\,\\text{v}=⟨2,-2⟩.\n$$\n\nFirst, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3\\cdot (-2)-2\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =-10\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|-10\\,|=10\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186268928 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "288e49b0-f706-54de-86b7-a17248fe2408" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Parallelogram Spanned by Two Non-Parallel Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4b4344ad-bea7-591b-9d9a-9df93765c2d4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268930} {:answer/id #uuid "dd3a11c5-b8fb-5f37-b8fa-32abeabab61a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "38" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268931} {:answer/id #uuid "77086d2f-6cf5-5165-a066-3de3857f04c7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "52" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268932} {:answer/id #uuid "6635e871-6a52-54ec-86f9-11b20903fd57" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "23" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268933} {:answer/id #uuid "9cb8f280-d04d-5ed7-8775-e4e765364d87" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268934}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6635e871-6a52-54ec-86f9-11b20903fd57" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "23" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268933} :answer-field/id #uuid "c5822dda-c371-5b0e-b20e-832764f977ca" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268929}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "7fe54472-016d-51ca-b2f6-6543f7ec9396" :question/math-academy-id "q-13951" :question/problem "Calculate the area of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}]$ and $\\text{v}=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 5 \\\\ -4 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}1 & 5 \\\\ -4 & 3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =1\\cdot 3-5\\cdot (-4) \\\\  & =23\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,23\\,|=23\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186268935 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "288e49b0-f706-54de-86b7-a17248fe2408" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Parallelogram Spanned by Two Non-Parallel Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a11aae4e-eb2a-53b9-b729-aa97885f2131" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "13" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268937}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a11aae4e-eb2a-53b9-b729-aa97885f2131" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "13" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268937} :answer-field/id #uuid "04afbf7d-4faa-596d-aa8f-7adff8c73e30" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268936}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "274e3fef-d560-53be-a236-cc5dab5cc853" :question/math-academy-id "q-320402" :question/problem "Determine the area $A$ of the parallelogram spanned by $\\text{u}=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]$ and $\\text{v}=[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}].$\n\n$\\,\\,A=$ {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 5\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3\\cdot 5-(-2)\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & =15-2 \\\\  & =13\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,13\\,|=13\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186268944 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0272b8d6-8400-5a6d-b51d-fc6ca84bd166" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Area of the Parallelogram Spanned by Two Parallel Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "74b714eb-784b-5de9-975f-fc0390650a1b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4\\sqrt{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268946} {:answer/id #uuid "355fc3ad-9f1d-52ab-8a17-d95b52098427" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\sqrt{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268947}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "74b714eb-784b-5de9-975f-fc0390650a1b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4\\sqrt{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268946} :answer-field/id #uuid "08592ac8-726f-534c-84c0-8a8e8dd42c78" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186268945}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "f2a974ab-e642-5854-9835-4feb37d0563f" :question/math-academy-id "q-320557" :question/problem "Given that the area spanned between the vectors $\\text{u}=[\\begin{aligned}2\\sqrt{2} \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]$ and $\\text{v}=[\\begin{aligned}a \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}]$ equals zero, what is the value of $a?$\n\n$a=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we construct a matrix where the columns are made up of the components of the corresponding vectors:\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}2\\sqrt{2} & a \\\\ 3 & 6\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}2\\sqrt{2} & a \\\\ 3 & 6\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(2\\sqrt{2})\\cdot 6-a\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =12\\sqrt{2}-3a\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, setting the expression for the determinant equal to $0$ and solving for $a,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}12\\sqrt{2}-3a & =0 \\\\ -3a & =-12\\sqrt{2} \\\\ a & =4\\sqrt{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}]}
